Here are two ideas for better use of high charisma (new features):

1)  WI > X means shopkeeper is quite unctuous.  He may say one
    or more of the following wonderful things:

    a) "Is there anything in particular I can help you find today?"
       (note: good luck or exceptional charisma means he may
        say "I don't have one right now but I'd be happy to
        order one for you...please prepay $XXX and come back in
        TTTT turns for delivery".  Outrageous luck or extra fee
        gets the thing DELIVERED by the mail daemon.)

    b) "Perhaps you'd find this (IDENTIFIED item) of interest"
       (note: bad luck or low charisma means he LIES...)
    
    c) "Say, that's a really nice (IDENTIFIED item).  Can I
       offer you $XXX for it?

2)  Pets love you so dearly that they follow you from distances
    >1 space away when using stairs.  CH16 = 2, 17 = 3, 18+ = anywhere
    in same room.


